# Notes and asides

## Markers

A sentence that ends with a footnote.:note:first:: Another sentence carries an
aside in the middle :aside:second:: and keeps going, and a third marker closes
the paragraph.:note:third::

:note: {:label: first} The first note, shown where it is written for now. ::

:aside: {:label: second} An aside with inline math $x^2 + 1$. ::

:note: {:label: third} The third note. ::

A later paragraph so the definitions sit between ordinary text.
